From 26dba1dcf4e869279fe1b55e00f2976ee0796950 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Turner Linux Port <turner@localhost>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 05:52:18 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] phy: mediatek: add MT6991 display D-PHY support

Implement the sleepable PLL sequence and lane controls used by the MT6991 display PHY. Preserve live impedance settings per PHY across a power cycle and acquire the power domain before accessing registers. Refuse a conflicting rate when taking over a running PLL.
